EPSG Geodetic Parameter Dataset
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

crates/terrio-crs/data/epsg.tsv.zst, datums.tsv.zst, epsg_vertical.tsv.zst and point_motion.tsv,
and the EPSG definitions in crates/terrio-crs/data/esri.tsv.zst, are derived from the EPSG
Geodetic Parameter Dataset (https://epsg.org), owned by the International Association of Oil &
Gas Producers (IOGP), through PROJ's database and GDAL. They are redistributed under the EPSG
Dataset Terms of Use (https://epsg.org/terms-of-use.html), with this attribution. They are not the EPSG Dataset itself, and
terrio is not endorsed by IOGP. The EPSG method and parameter names and codes in
crates/terrio-crs/src/projjson_write.rs and crates/terrio/src/drivers/vector/projjson.rs come
from the same dataset.
crates/terrio-crs/src/projjson_db.tsv.zst is derived from the same dataset (EPSG v12.029), through
PROJ 9.7.1's database, under the same terms; the EPSG method and parameter names and codes in
crates/terrio-crs/src/projjson_gdal.rs come from it too.

