-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
IAU_2015 definitions
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

crates/terrio-crs/data/iau.tsv.zst and iau-source.json are derived from PROJ 9.8.1's
data/sql/iau.sql, Git blob 900564ccf2e1f77fb708ddc2c8544843b29bc24a, generated by
scripts/build_db_from_iau.py (Copyright (c) 2021, Hobu Inc; author Even Rouault), under PROJ's
license (see the PROJ section). The source planetary reference is the IAU Working Group report
at https://doi.org/10.1007/s10569-017-9805-5 .

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
CRS benchmark reference data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The pair-4979-4978, pair-mars-iau, form-27700-projjson, seed-tpers, edge-tpers-back,
seed-igh, seed-ob_tran-moll, method-qsc, method-healpix and method-rhealpix numeric fixtures are from Michael Sumner's rust-proj-capability
(https://github.com/mdsumner/rust-proj-capability), revision
ddd9fac70ec370acd9651ebb8b46035207347ad5, generated with PROJ 9.9.0.
The CRS-study oracle version is retained separately from projection-suite data.
The repository carries no license yet; terrio has asked its author for one (see
LICENSES/LicenseRef-rust-proj-capability.txt in https://github.com/opengeos/terrio).

